<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Tranquilidade boosts premiums.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Tranquilidade boosts premiums.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Companhia de Seguros Tranquilidade said it boosted premium income 34 percent over the first nine months of the year to 91.4 billion escudos ($588 million).</p>
<p>Life insurance grew 57 percent to more than 55 billion escudos compared with the same period last year.</p>
<p>Non-life premiums were up 9.5 percent at around 36.4 billion. ($1=155.334 escudos)</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3113121</p>
</text>
